### Variables
@baseUrl = @{{$dotenv API_URL}}
@rbacUrl = @{{$dotenv RBAC_URL}}
@token = {{signIn.response.body.access_token}}

### Health Check
GET {{baseUrl}}/auth/health

### Login exitoso
# @name signIn
POST {{baseUrl}}/auth/signIn
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "username": "superadmin",
  "password": "SuperSecure123!"
}

### Usar token en endpoint protegido
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/some-resource
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### Verificar directamente con RBAC (comparación)
POST {{rbacUrl}}/auth/login
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "username": "superadmin",
  "password": "SuperSecure123!"
}